  "properties": {
    "title": "New Caledonia administrative and jurisdictional boundaries (long table)",
    "description": "All boundary levels for New Caledonia, from the EEZ to the finest published level, stacked in one table (one row per unit per level). Sources: Gouvernement de la Nouvelle-Caledonie (DINUM SGT), Georep, \"Aires coutumieres\" (ncl-gnc-aires-coutumieres-2020); Gouvernement de la Nouvelle-Caledonie (DINUM - Service de la Geomatique et Teledetection; formerly DITTT), Georep, \"Limites administratives terrestres (communes, provinces)\" (ncl-gnc-limites-terrestres-2024); Ville de Noumea, \"Quartiers de la ville de Noumea\" (ncl-noumea-quartiers); Pacific Community (SPC), Geoscience, Energy and Maritime Division, \"Global Exclusive Economic Zones (200 Nautical Miles) - Merged Dataset (SPC Pacific Maritime Boundaries)\" (spc-gem-pacific-eez-200nm). Licences (per row in the `license` column): CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, LO-2.0. Some rows are used and redistributed by this project under a data-use agreement (CSDR-SPC data use agreement (user-confirmed 2026-11-20)); downstream users are bound by the row's public licence (e.g. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) unless they hold their own agreement. Full provenance and source notes: https://github.com/SustainableDevelopmentReform/pacific-administrative-boundaries/blob/v0.1.0/docs/sources.md#ncl-new-caledonia.",
